  "account": "锦绣千秋录",
  "source_title": "满山落叶松一夜烧成金色，湖面上漂着不肯在浑水里开的白花。秋天最有诗意的榜首湖水，凭什么排第一。\n#中国秋天 #秋日湖水 #神州秋色",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_1043581b585fd72d_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 471.157007,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国秋天最有诗意的湖泊是哪一个吗？上集，咱们聊了瘦西湖、长白山天池、洱海、纳木错、洞庭湖这一集，直接揭开谜底，看看前五名。诗意到什么当家，尤其是排在榜首的那个湖湖边的人家，至今还是女人当家。一入深秋，岸边的草海，黄成一片像铺开的金毯子，画不多说，茶给您沏好了，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，咱们这就开讲。第五名，杭州西湖这个名字不用多介绍，小学课本里就有它，他不过六平方公里多，却被叫了一千年的人间天堂。白居易做杭州刺史，修了白堤。两百多年后，苏东坡来了，修了苏堤，一个接一个把一湖水写进了无数首势。秋天的西湖月亮一出来，湖面泛着荧光，满爵拢的桂花被风一吹，落进水里香都浮在水面上，再到残骸的时候，听一场雨，淅淅沥沥不吵，却把人心洗得清清楚楚，浓墨重彩都过去了，剩下的是平淡里的真意，这才叫送运。您要是秋天去，别赶热闹，挑个下雨的，傍晚在湖边找个地方坐着，听雨，比什么景点都值。第四名，青海湖，他在青藏高原上海拔三千二百多米，面积四千四百多平方公里，是中国最大的内陆咸水湖。环湖一圈，三百六十多公里，夏天，油菜花铺天盖地，游客挤满了湖边的路可一入深秋，花谢了人散了，湖水难得苍茫连天的秋草，一片金黄。南迁的天鹅在水草间落脚，安安静静，连风都走得很轻。您站在岸边，想不安静都难。王昌龄写青海长云暗雪山写的就是这片燎原热闹，是别人的湖，还是那这个湖，他从来没为谁变过，脸色繁华褪尽，才见素朴的真容。人到了下半辈子，看淡名利，内里反而更满。第深处，新疆喀纳斯湖，它藏在阿尔泰山密林深处，离最近的县城一百多公里，湖面不到四十六平方公里，最深处一百八十多米，蒙古语离喀纳斯市美丽而神秘。深秋时节，满山的落叶松一夜变成金黄，像巨浪一层压着一层直往天上堆。清晨，月亮湾和神仙湾的水面升起，薄雾奶蓝色的湖水在雾里半隐半现雾一散。金黄的林子倒映进水里，像一幅泼上去的大画。这样的景色不用您读多少诗，一眼就够了。清早去的人裹着厚外套，站在观景台上，一边哈白气，一边等雾散，没人舍得先走，诗意不止在案头，更在万里山河。第二名，江西鄱阳湖三千多平方公里的浩瀚水域，是中国第一大淡水湖，也是滕王阁序里最鲜活的注脚。然而，他最神奇的时刻，偏偏是深秋。枯水期，水位缓缓退去辽阔，湖滩奇迹般化作万顷，粉紫色燎紫花海，与茫茫芦苇荡数十万只，候鸟振翅齐飞。千年前的落星墩，古石岛，孤傲，挺立于草海之中。落霞与孤鹜齐飞，秋水共长天一色，在这儿成了触手可及的现实。水掌为浩渺，大湖水落为万千花海，大自然以枯荣起落，书写生命韵律。人生起落终有常从容。面对及是景第一名，泸沽湖、川滇交界的崇山峻岭之中，为什么是他他不再闹事，也不跟群山争高。他藏在川边交界的高山深处，海拔两千六百多米，最深处将近一百米。水清的能看见很深的水下湖面，差不多有五十平方公里，四周的山倒映进去，一点杂色都没有。海菜花一朵一朵，浮在水面，一阵风过花影，跟着水纹轻轻晃晃的人心里发软。它没有一首教科书里的明片，也没有一座让人登高的明楼。可您深秋清晨走到湖边，会看见金黄的草海，随风一拂一起洁白的海菜花，静静浮在水面。这种花水不干净到极处。他不肯开，乘雾没散，湖心有一叶株，草船慢慢划过。船是整根树干，掏空坐的摩梭人划了不知多少代桨入水，几乎听不见响动，生怕惊了这一湖的安静。船上的人不急得去哪儿，也不跟谁比。湖边的摩梭人至今保留着母系的家，女人当家一家老小，围着最年长的女性过日子。前九个湖，有的靠千古名篇留名，有的靠天地大美经验泸沽湖什么都不靠。他给人的是看透世事喧嚣之后，终于找回的那一口平井。这不是读出来的诗，是从心里长出来的，氨有人在湖边一坐，眼泪就下来了。说不清，为什么？只觉得总算到家了十个虎，讲完了。瘦西湖瘦成一幅长卷，天池在云端孤傲洱海，让人敢慢下来。纳木错让人放下心事。洞庭湖装着杜甫的泪和范仲淹的胸襟，西湖把平淡熬出了真位。青海湖在繁华散尽后，素朴辽远，喀纳斯把整座山烧成金色的画鄱阳湖在掌落里教人从容，可只有泸沽湖名篇，没靠高度没争，就把诗意走到了最深的地方。有的湖让人赞叹，有的湖让人感慨，只有他让人安最有诗意的湖，不是最美的。那一个是您看完之后，心里那口气终于顺了的。那一个最后问问您，这十个湖，您去过几个最想去的是哪一个？评论区告诉我，觉得这期让您成了见识，就转给身边跟您一样爱看山河湖海的人，想听更多秋天里的湖光山色。点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00001",
      "start_ms": 310,
      "end_ms": 4050,
      "text": "您知道中国秋天最有诗意的湖泊是哪一个吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4570,
      "end_ms": 5190,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5210,
      "end_ms": 12250,
      "text": "咱们聊了瘦西湖、长白山天池、洱海、纳木错、洞庭湖这一集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00004",
      "start_ms": 12370,
      "end_ms": 13630,
      "text": "直接揭开谜底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00005",
      "start_ms": 13930,
      "end_ms": 15190,
      "text": "看看前五名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00006",
      "start_ms": 15370,
      "end_ms": 16670,
      "text": "诗意到什么当家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00007",
      "start_ms": 17030,
      "end_ms": 20870,
      "text": "尤其是排在榜首的那个湖湖边的人家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00008",
      "start_ms": 21230,
      "end_ms": 23070,
      "text": "至今还是女人当家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00009",
      "start_ms": 23790,
      "end_ms": 24810,
      "text": "一入深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00010",
      "start_ms": 25110,
      "end_ms": 26310,
      "text": "岸边的草海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26370,
      "end_ms": 29250,
      "text": "黄成一片像铺开的金毯子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00012",
      "start_ms": 29630,
      "end_ms": 30540,
      "text": "画不多说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00013",
      "start_ms": 30960,
      "end_ms": 32340,
      "text": "茶给您沏好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00014",
      "start_ms": 32600,
      "end_ms": 34500,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00015",
      "start_ms": 34720,
      "end_ms": 35820,
      "text": "咱们这就开讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00016",
      "start_ms": 36140,
      "end_ms": 36840,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00017",
      "start_ms": 37440,
      "end_ms": 40920,
      "text": "杭州西湖这个名字不用多介绍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41280,
      "end_ms": 42780,
      "text": "小学课本里就有它，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00019",
      "start_ms": 43380,
      "end_ms": 45360,
      "text": "他不过六平方公里多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00020",
      "start_ms": 45760,
      "end_ms": 48640,
      "text": "却被叫了一千年的人间天堂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00021",
      "start_ms": 49160,
      "end_ms": 50920,
      "text": "白居易做杭州刺史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00022",
      "start_ms": 51380,
      "end_ms": 52120,
      "text": "修了白堤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00023",
      "start_ms": 52980,
      "end_ms": 53980,
      "text": "两百多年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00024",
      "start_ms": 54080,
      "end_ms": 55060,
      "text": "苏东坡来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00025",
      "start_ms": 55600,
      "end_ms": 56440,
      "text": "修了苏堤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00026",
      "start_ms": 57020,
      "end_ms": 60795,
      "text": "一个接一个把一湖水写进了无数首势。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00027",
      "start_ms": 61380,
      "end_ms": 64325,
      "text": "秋天的西湖月亮一出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00028",
      "start_ms": 64720,
      "end_ms": 66365,
      "text": "湖面泛着荧光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00029",
      "start_ms": 67150,
      "end_ms": 69750,
      "text": "满爵拢的桂花被风一吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00030",
      "start_ms": 70030,
      "end_ms": 73235,
      "text": "落进水里香都浮在水面上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00031",
      "start_ms": 73940,
      "end_ms": 75555,
      "text": "再到残骸的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00032",
      "start_ms": 75980,
      "end_ms": 76985,
      "text": "听一场雨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00033",
      "start_ms": 77370,
      "end_ms": 79085,
      "text": "淅淅沥沥不吵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00034",
      "start_ms": 79570,
      "end_ms": 81905,
      "text": "却把人心洗得清清楚楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00035",
      "start_ms": 82330,
      "end_ms": 84085,
      "text": "浓墨重彩都过去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00036",
      "start_ms": 84630,
      "end_ms": 87125,
      "text": "剩下的是平淡里的真意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00037",
      "start_ms": 87550,
      "end_ms": 88755,
      "text": "这才叫送运。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00038",
      "start_ms": 89450,
      "end_ms": 90730,
      "text": "您要是秋天去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00039",
      "start_ms": 91050,
      "end_ms": 92055,
      "text": "别赶热闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00040",
      "start_ms": 92470,
      "end_ms": 93350,
      "text": "挑个下雨的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00041",
      "start_ms": 93350,
      "end_ms": 95900,
      "text": "傍晚在湖边找个地方坐着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00042",
      "start_ms": 95900,
      "end_ms": 96360,
      "text": "听雨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00043",
      "start_ms": 96580,
      "end_ms": 98165,
      "text": "比什么景点都值。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00044",
      "start_ms": 98530,
      "end_ms": 99315,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00045",
      "start_ms": 99730,
      "end_ms": 100555,
      "text": "青海湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00046",
      "start_ms": 101500,
      "end_ms": 105205,
      "text": "他在青藏高原上海拔三千二百多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00047",
      "start_ms": 105640,
      "end_ms": 108205,
      "text": "面积四千四百多平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00048",
      "start_ms": 108800,
      "end_ms": 111515,
      "text": "是中国最大的内陆咸水湖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00049",
      "start_ms": 112270,
      "end_ms": 113270,
      "text": "环湖一圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00050",
      "start_ms": 113450,
      "end_ms": 114785,
      "text": "三百六十多公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00051",
      "start_ms": 115250,
      "end_ms": 115710,
      "text": "夏天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00052",
      "start_ms": 115850,
      "end_ms": 117385,
      "text": "油菜花铺天盖地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00053",
      "start_ms": 117700,
      "end_ms": 121010,
      "text": "游客挤满了湖边的路可一入深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00054",
      "start_ms": 121450,
      "end_ms": 123710,
      "text": "花谢了人散了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00055",
      "start_ms": 124170,
      "end_ms": 127670,
      "text": "湖水难得苍茫连天的秋草，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00056",
      "start_ms": 127790,
      "end_ms": 128730,
      "text": "一片金黄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00057",
      "start_ms": 129630,
      "end_ms": 132390,
      "text": "南迁的天鹅在水草间落脚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00058",
      "start_ms": 132930,
      "end_ms": 133950,
      "text": "安安静静，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00059",
      "start_ms": 134330,
      "end_ms": 135910,
      "text": "连风都走得很轻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00060",
      "start_ms": 136770,
      "end_ms": 138010,
      "text": "您站在岸边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00061",
      "start_ms": 138510,
      "end_ms": 140050,
      "text": "想不安静都难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00062",
      "start_ms": 140450,
      "end_ms": 147170,
      "text": "王昌龄写青海长云暗雪山写的就是这片燎原热闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00063",
      "start_ms": 147170,
      "end_ms": 148810,
      "text": "是别人的湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00064",
      "start_ms": 149170,
      "end_ms": 150200,
      "text": "还是那这个湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00065",
      "start_ms": 150920,
      "end_ms": 152720,
      "text": "他从来没为谁变过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00066",
      "start_ms": 152720,
      "end_ms": 154920,
      "text": "脸色繁华褪尽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00067",
      "start_ms": 155280,
      "end_ms": 156840,
      "text": "才见素朴的真容。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00068",
      "start_ms": 157580,
      "end_ms": 159100,
      "text": "人到了下半辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00069",
      "start_ms": 159500,
      "end_ms": 160540,
      "text": "看淡名利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00070",
      "start_ms": 160900,
      "end_ms": 162460,
      "text": "内里反而更满。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00071",
      "start_ms": 162800,
      "end_ms": 163420,
      "text": "第深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00072",
      "start_ms": 164020,
      "end_ms": 165220,
      "text": "新疆喀纳斯湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00073",
      "start_ms": 165879,
      "end_ms": 168380,
      "text": "它藏在阿尔泰山密林深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00074",
      "start_ms": 169040,
      "end_ms": 171680,
      "text": "离最近的县城一百多公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00075",
      "start_ms": 172060,
      "end_ms": 174540,
      "text": "湖面不到四十六平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00076",
      "start_ms": 174960,
      "end_ms": 177060,
      "text": "最深处一百八十多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00077",
      "start_ms": 177440,
      "end_ms": 180935,
      "text": "蒙古语离喀纳斯市美丽而神秘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00078",
      "start_ms": 181420,
      "end_ms": 182425,
      "text": "深秋时节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00079",
      "start_ms": 182790,
      "end_ms": 185965,
      "text": "满山的落叶松一夜变成金黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00080",
      "start_ms": 186400,
      "end_ms": 190275,
      "text": "像巨浪一层压着一层直往天上堆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00081",
      "start_ms": 190720,
      "end_ms": 191240,
      "text": "清晨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00082",
      "start_ms": 191540,
      "end_ms": 194540,
      "text": "月亮湾和神仙湾的水面升起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00083",
      "start_ms": 194620,
      "end_ms": 200365,
      "text": "薄雾奶蓝色的湖水在雾里半隐半现雾一散。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00084",
      "start_ms": 200720,
      "end_ms": 203235,
      "text": "金黄的林子倒映进水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00085",
      "start_ms": 203720,
      "end_ms": 205865,
      "text": "像一幅泼上去的大画。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00086",
      "start_ms": 206220,
      "end_ms": 209325,
      "text": "这样的景色不用您读多少诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00087",
      "start_ms": 209880,
      "end_ms": 210875,
      "text": "一眼就够了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00088",
      "start_ms": 211780,
      "end_ms": 214625,
      "text": "清早去的人裹着厚外套，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00089",
      "start_ms": 215270,
      "end_ms": 216725,
      "text": "站在观景台上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00090",
      "start_ms": 217150,
      "end_ms": 218250,
      "text": "一边哈白气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00091",
      "start_ms": 218570,
      "end_ms": 219885,
      "text": "一边等雾散，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00092",
      "start_ms": 220400,
      "end_ms": 221795,
      "text": "没人舍得先走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00093",
      "start_ms": 222230,
      "end_ms": 223970,
      "text": "诗意不止在案头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00094",
      "start_ms": 224330,
      "end_ms": 226085,
      "text": "更在万里山河。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00095",
      "start_ms": 226470,
      "end_ms": 227030,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00096",
      "start_ms": 227270,
      "end_ms": 231495,
      "text": "江西鄱阳湖三千多平方公里的浩瀚水域，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00097",
      "start_ms": 231840,
      "end_ms": 233585,
      "text": "是中国第一大淡水湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00098",
      "start_ms": 234040,
      "end_ms": 236835,
      "text": "也是滕王阁序里最鲜活的注脚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00099",
      "start_ms": 237620,
      "end_ms": 238020,
      "text": "然而，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00100",
      "start_ms": 238020,
      "end_ms": 239445,
      "text": "他最神奇的时刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00101",
      "start_ms": 239810,
      "end_ms": 240930,
      "text": "偏偏是深秋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00102",
      "start_ms": 241010,
      "end_ms": 241685,
      "text": "枯水期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00103",
      "start_ms": 242350,
      "end_ms": 245000,
      "text": "水位缓缓退去辽阔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00104",
      "start_ms": 245140,
      "end_ms": 247660,
      "text": "湖滩奇迹般化作万顷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00105",
      "start_ms": 247840,
      "end_ms": 249825,
      "text": "粉紫色燎紫花海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00106",
      "start_ms": 250230,
      "end_ms": 252950,
      "text": "与茫茫芦苇荡数十万只，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00107",
      "start_ms": 252950,
      "end_ms": 254625,
      "text": "候鸟振翅齐飞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00108",
      "start_ms": 255330,
      "end_ms": 256730,
      "text": "千年前的落星墩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00109",
      "start_ms": 256910,
      "end_ms": 257665,
      "text": "古石岛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00110",
      "start_ms": 257950,
      "end_ms": 258310,
      "text": "孤傲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00111",
      "start_ms": 258310,
      "end_ms": 259815,
      "text": "挺立于草海之中。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00112",
      "start_ms": 260170,
      "end_ms": 261670,
      "text": "落霞与孤鹜齐飞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00113",
      "start_ms": 262050,
      "end_ms": 263995,
      "text": "秋水共长天一色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00114",
      "start_ms": 264310,
      "end_ms": 266385,
      "text": "在这儿成了触手可及的现实。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00115",
      "start_ms": 266830,
      "end_ms": 268090,
      "text": "水掌为浩渺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00116",
      "start_ms": 268130,
      "end_ms": 271235,
      "text": "大湖水落为万千花海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00117",
      "start_ms": 271770,
      "end_ms": 273550,
      "text": "大自然以枯荣起落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00118",
      "start_ms": 273710,
      "end_ms": 275145,
      "text": "书写生命韵律。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00119",
      "start_ms": 275710,
      "end_ms": 278030,
      "text": "人生起落终有常从容。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00120",
      "start_ms": 278090,
      "end_ms": 280365,
      "text": "面对及是景第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00121",
      "start_ms": 280770,
      "end_ms": 284195,
      "text": "泸沽湖、川滇交界的崇山峻岭之中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00122",
      "start_ms": 284600,
      "end_ms": 287105,
      "text": "为什么是他他不再闹事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00123",
      "start_ms": 287530,
      "end_ms": 289095,
      "text": "也不跟群山争高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00124",
      "start_ms": 289710,
      "end_ms": 292605,
      "text": "他藏在川边交界的高山深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00125",
      "start_ms": 293130,
      "end_ms": 294795,
      "text": "海拔两千六百多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00126",
      "start_ms": 295310,
      "end_ms": 297115,
      "text": "最深处将近一百米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00127",
      "start_ms": 297630,
      "end_ms": 301050,
      "text": "水清的能看见很深的水下湖面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00128",
      "start_ms": 301090,
      "end_ms": 302910,
      "text": "差不多有五十平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00129",
      "start_ms": 303290,
      "end_ms": 305890,
      "text": "四周的山倒映进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00130",
      "start_ms": 306270,
      "end_ms": 308050,
      "text": "一点杂色都没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00131",
      "start_ms": 308750,
      "end_ms": 310630,
      "text": "海菜花一朵一朵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00132",
      "start_ms": 310650,
      "end_ms": 311590,
      "text": "浮在水面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00133",
      "start_ms": 312010,
      "end_ms": 313910,
      "text": "一阵风过花影，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00134",
      "start_ms": 314010,
      "end_ms": 317810,
      "text": "跟着水纹轻轻晃晃的人心里发软。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00135",
      "start_ms": 318250,
      "end_ms": 320430,
      "text": "它没有一首教科书里的明片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00136",
      "start_ms": 321210,
      "end_ms": 324090,
      "text": "也没有一座让人登高的明楼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00137",
      "start_ms": 324490,
      "end_ms": 326905,
      "text": "可您深秋清晨走到湖边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00138",
      "start_ms": 327360,
      "end_ms": 329080,
      "text": "会看见金黄的草海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00139",
      "start_ms": 329120,
      "end_ms": 332320,
      "text": "随风一拂一起洁白的海菜花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00140",
      "start_ms": 332380,
      "end_ms": 333560,
      "text": "静静浮在水面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00141",
      "start_ms": 334240,
      "end_ms": 336800,
      "text": "这种花水不干净到极处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00142",
      "start_ms": 337020,
      "end_ms": 337760,
      "text": "他不肯开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00143",
      "start_ms": 338280,
      "end_ms": 339380,
      "text": "乘雾没散，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00144",
      "start_ms": 340120,
      "end_ms": 341580,
      "text": "湖心有一叶株，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00145",
      "start_ms": 341580,
      "end_ms": 343560,
      "text": "草船慢慢划过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00146",
      "start_ms": 344060,
      "end_ms": 345600,
      "text": "船是整根树干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00147",
      "start_ms": 345620,
      "end_ms": 350500,
      "text": "掏空坐的摩梭人划了不知多少代桨入水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00148",
      "start_ms": 350600,
      "end_ms": 352000,
      "text": "几乎听不见响动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00149",
      "start_ms": 352560,
      "end_ms": 354460,
      "text": "生怕惊了这一湖的安静。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00150",
      "start_ms": 354460,
      "end_ms": 357085,
      "text": "船上的人不急得去哪儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00151",
      "start_ms": 357380,
      "end_ms": 358315,
      "text": "也不跟谁比。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00152",
      "start_ms": 359110,
      "end_ms": 362705,
      "text": "湖边的摩梭人至今保留着母系的家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00153",
      "start_ms": 363110,
      "end_ms": 365215,
      "text": "女人当家一家老小，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00154",
      "start_ms": 365580,
      "end_ms": 367905,
      "text": "围着最年长的女性过日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00155",
      "start_ms": 368310,
      "end_ms": 369405,
      "text": "前九个湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00156",
      "start_ms": 369890,
      "end_ms": 372065,
      "text": "有的靠千古名篇留名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00157",
      "start_ms": 372740,
      "end_ms": 377265,
      "text": "有的靠天地大美经验泸沽湖什么都不靠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00158",
      "start_ms": 377770,
      "end_ms": 381245,
      "text": "他给人的是看透世事喧嚣之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00159",
      "start_ms": 381640,
      "end_ms": 383895,
      "text": "终于找回的那一口平井。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00160",
      "start_ms": 384340,
      "end_ms": 386025,
      "text": "这不是读出来的诗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00161",
      "start_ms": 386510,
      "end_ms": 388290,
      "text": "是从心里长出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00162",
      "start_ms": 388290,
      "end_ms": 390695,
      "text": "氨有人在湖边一坐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00163",
      "start_ms": 391080,
      "end_ms": 392285,
      "text": "眼泪就下来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00164",
      "start_ms": 392690,
      "end_ms": 393270,
      "text": "说不清，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00165",
      "start_ms": 393270,
      "end_ms": 393915,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00166",
      "start_ms": 394250,
      "end_ms": 397310,
      "text": "只觉得总算到家了十个虎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00167",
      "start_ms": 397310,
      "end_ms": 397925,
      "text": "讲完了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00168",
      "start_ms": 398750,
      "end_ms": 401085,
      "text": "瘦西湖瘦成一幅长卷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00169",
      "start_ms": 401680,
      "end_ms": 404460,
      "text": "天池在云端孤傲洱海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00170",
      "start_ms": 404480,
      "end_ms": 405985,
      "text": "让人敢慢下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00171",
      "start_ms": 406410,
      "end_ms": 408505,
      "text": "纳木错让人放下心事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00172",
      "start_ms": 409060,
      "end_ms": 412525,
      "text": "洞庭湖装着杜甫的泪和范仲淹的胸襟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00173",
      "start_ms": 413350,
      "end_ms": 415735,
      "text": "西湖把平淡熬出了真位。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00174",
      "start_ms": 416130,
      "end_ms": 418290,
      "text": "青海湖在繁华散尽后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00175",
      "start_ms": 418330,
      "end_ms": 419405,
      "text": "素朴辽远，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00176",
      "start_ms": 419780,
      "end_ms": 425925,
      "text": "喀纳斯把整座山烧成金色的画鄱阳湖在掌落里教人从容，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00177",
      "start_ms": 426600,
      "end_ms": 428890,
      "text": "可只有泸沽湖名篇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00178",
      "start_ms": 428950,
      "end_ms": 430715,
      "text": "没靠高度没争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00179",
      "start_ms": 431030,
      "end_ms": 433285,
      "text": "就把诗意走到了最深的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00180",
      "start_ms": 433690,
      "end_ms": 435490,
      "text": "有的湖让人赞叹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00181",
      "start_ms": 435710,
      "end_ms": 437575,
      "text": "有的湖让人感慨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00182",
      "start_ms": 438080,
      "end_ms": 441895,
      "text": "只有他让人安最有诗意的湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00183",
      "start_ms": 442460,
      "end_ms": 443480,
      "text": "不是最美的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00184",
      "start_ms": 443480,
      "end_ms": 446305,
      "text": "那一个是您看完之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00185",
      "start_ms": 446700,
      "end_ms": 449060,
      "text": "心里那口气终于顺了的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00186",
      "start_ms": 449060,
      "end_ms": 451275,
      "text": "那一个最后问问您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00187",
      "start_ms": 451790,
      "end_ms": 452745,
      "text": "这十个湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00188",
      "start_ms": 453080,
      "end_ms": 456475,
      "text": "您去过几个最想去的是哪一个？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00189",
      "start_ms": 456870,
      "end_ms": 457975,
      "text": "评论区告诉我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00190",
      "start_ms": 458430,
      "end_ms": 460615,
      "text": "觉得这期让您成了见识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00191",
      "start_ms": 461020,
      "end_ms": 464775,
      "text": "就转给身边跟您一样爱看山河湖海的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00192",
      "start_ms": 465500,
      "end_ms": 468185,
      "text": "想听更多秋天里的湖光山色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00193",
      "start_ms": 468460,
      "end_ms": 469205,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1043581b585fd72d_s00194",
      "start_ms": 469450,
      "end_ms": 470935,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
